      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Press Ctrl to run (drains stamina)\r\n\r\n2. Press I to open/close
    inventory. Hover over items to show equip/drop buttons\r\n\r\n3. Press E to open/close
    keypad. Password: 1234\r\n\r\n4. Weapon upgrade bench activates on proximity
    by pressing E. Press Esc to exit upgrade UI\r\n\r\n5. Hold Space to apply upgrades
    to weapons in the upgrade UI\r\n\r\n6. Crafting Recipes:\r\n   Molotov = Alcohol
    + Rags\r\n   Bandage = Alcohol + Rags\r\n   Makeshift Knife = Metal Scrap + Rags\r\n  
    \r\n   Drag and drop raw materials onto each other in your inventory to craft"
